eck since the d-file would be open from d1 to d7. This forcing move makes Black's king move, allowing me to seize the initiative and potentially coordinate my pieces for a winning attack. Checks are forcing moves that limit the opponent's options and in this superior material position, I should press my advantage actively.\n\nAnswer: R: f1-d1"}
