 the g7 pawn\n- Keeps Black's king restricted to the back ranks\n- Maintains maximum pressure without allowing exchanges\n- The 7th rank rook can attack pawns from behind and support my own pawn advances\n\nThis is a classical winning strategy with a rook on the 7th rank.\n\nAnswer: R: d8-d7"}
