 (the king must take since it's the only way to get out of check), I will have an overwhelming material advantage of King + 5 pawns vs King + Knight + 2 pawns, which should be easily winning. This is clearly the best move as it wins material forcibly.\n\nAnswer: R: f1-f7"}
