strict Black\'s king\n- Creates immediate tactical threats\n- Maintains the initiative\n\nIn rook endgames, the 7th rank is extremely valuable ("a rook on the 7th rank is worth a pawn"), and giving check while claiming it is the most forcing and best continuation.\n\nAnswer: R: f8-f7'}
