es the king, removing any promotion threats. With only a lone king remaining, Black will have no way to generate counterplay, making my task of advancing my pawns and delivering checkmate straightforward. Material advantage is decisive in endgames, and maximizing that advantage by removing Black's last piece is the most certain path to victory.\n\nAnswer: R: c5-a5"}
