trongest move because:\n- It gives check, forcing Black to respond\n- It cuts off the king from the h-file and controls the 5th rank\n- After the king moves (likely to g3), I can continue to restrict it with my rook while advancing my pawns\n- This is the most forcing move that maintains pressure and pushes toward a quick victory\n\nAnswer: R: a5-h5"}
