nces my most dangerous passed pawn and the black King on h5 is 4-5 moves away from catching it. This creates an immediate winning threat that Black must address, and even if the King rushes over, I can support with my King or create diversions with other pawns. This is the most direct path to victory.\n\nAnswer: P: e3-e4"}
